      "refersTo": "track-row",
      "description": "Fila de la lista de temas bajo un rótulo de lado: número A1, título, artistas y género, año y número de catálogo.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-lado\"><h2 class=\"ds-rotulo\">Lado A</h2><ol class=\"ds-pistas\"><li class=\"ds-pista\"><span class=\"ds-n\">A1</span><a class=\"ds-t\" href=\"#\">Bocanada</a><span class=\"ds-meta\">Gustavo Cerati — Rock</span><span class=\"ds-der\"><b>1999</b><span class=\"ds-cat\">GM-0001</span></span></li><li class=\"ds-pista\"><span class=\"ds-n\">A2</span><a class=\"ds-t\" href=\"#\">Clics modernos</a><span class=\"ds-meta\">Charly García — Rock</span><span class=\"ds-der\"><b>1983</b><span class=\"ds-cat\">GM-0002</span></span></li></ol></section>",
      "css": ".ds-lado{font-family:var(--sans,'Archivo',system-ui,sans-serif);color:var(--tinta,#f2f2ee);background:var(--funda,#141414);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}.ds-rotulo{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--etiqueta,#e2b33c);padding-bottom:8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--filete-fuerte,#3d3d3b);}.ds-pistas{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;}.ds-pista{position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:40px 1fr auto;gap:4px 14px;align-items:baseline;padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--filete,#2a2a29);}.ds-n{color:var(--gris,#a3a39c);font-weight:500;font-size:14px;}.ds-pista:hover .ds-n,.ds-pista:focus-within .ds-n{color:var(--etiqueta,#e2b33c);}.ds-t{font-weight:700;font-size:18px;line-height:1.3;text-decoration:none;color:var(--tinta,#f2f2ee);}.ds-t::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;}.ds-t:hover{color:var(--etiqueta-viva,#f0c75a);}.ds-t:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--etiqueta,#e2b33c);outline-offset:2px;}.ds-meta{grid-column:2;color:var(--gris,#a3a39c);font-size:14px;}.ds-der{grid-column:3;grid-row:1 / span 2;text-align:right;font-size:14px;color:var(--gris,#a3a39c);white-space:nowrap;}.ds-der b{display:block;color:var(--tinta,#f2f2ee);font-weight:500;font-size:15px;}.ds-cat{font-family:var(--mono,ui-monospace,Consolas,monospace);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.04em;}"
